                "title": "Rope Entry Lockset",
                "description": "Omnia's Rope Entry Lockset design the edges of both the handle and the backplate are wonderfully adorned with rope detailing, just enough to give the piece a subtle point of interest. The Rope Design Entry Lockset is available in a single cylinder lock function as well as a full dummy set for use on the inactive door of a pair of double doors. Choose from polished brass, satin chrome, and shaded bronze. \r\n",
